<h2 class="blog-title">
<a class="blog-title-link blog-link" href="../../blog/7676917.html">黏巴達 武器</a>
</h2>
<p class="blog-date">
<span class="date-text">
		7/14/2019
	</span>
</p>
<p class="blog-comments">
<a class="blog-link" href="../../blog/7676917.html#comments">
<fb:comments-count href="../../blog/7676917.html"></fb:comments-count> <span class="fb_comment_count_label">評論</span>
</a>
</p>
</div>
<div class="blog-separator"> </div>
<div class="blog-content">
<span class="imgPusher" style="float:left;height:0px"></span><span style="display: table;width:auto;position:relative;float:left;max-width:100%;;clear:left;margin-top:0px;*margin-top:0px"><a><img alt="圖片" class="galleryImageBorder wsite-image" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/editor/img-7848.jpg?250" style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 10px; border-width:0; max-width:100%"/></a><span class="wsite-caption" style="display: table-caption; caption-side: bottom; font-size: 90%; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"></span></span> <div class="paragraph" style="display:block;">​第一天我發現玩火已經無法滿足自己了，急著想要做一把武器，馬上就花了二十分鐘，找到了一根又直又長的蒲葵葉梗，首先要先鋸掉比較彎曲的地方，一分鐘就鋸完了，接著拿小刀把刺給削掉，捆上線加上劍鄂，最後把前頭割一個適合橡皮筋槍的凹縫就完成了。覺得很有成就感，一把劍那麼快就完成了，尤其是美觀、長度、功能與重量，都非常的適合我。<br/></div> <hr style="width:100%;clear:both;visibility:hidden;"/> <span class="imgPusher" style="float:left;height:82px"></span><span style="display: table;width:auto;position:relative;float:left;max-width:100%;;clear:left;margin-top:20px;*margin-top:40px"><a><img alt="圖片" class="galleryImageBorder wsite-image" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/editor/img-7847_1.jpg?1563160134" style="margin-top: 5px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 10px; border-width:1px;padding:3px; max-width:100%"/></a><span class="wsite-caption" style="display: table-caption; caption-side: bottom; font-size: 90%; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"></span></span> <div class="paragraph" style="display:block;"><span style="color:rgb(98, 98, 98)">第二天我急性子又想做一把劍，做法跟前一支劍一樣，第三天時，為了讓它上場，加上軟墊，我覺得很實用。</span></div> <hr style="width:100%;clear:both;visibility:hidden;"/> <span class="imgPusher" style="float:right;height:0px"></span><span style="display: table;width:244px;position:relative;float:right;max-width:100%;;clear:right;margin-top:0px;*margin-top:0px"><a><img alt="圖片" class="galleryImageBorder wsite-image" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/published/img-7858.jpg?1563160262" style="margin-top: 10px; margin-bottom: 10px; margin-left: 0px; margin-right: 10px; border-width:0; max-width:100%"/></a><span class="wsite-caption" style="display: table-caption; caption-side: bottom; font-size: 90%; margin-top: -10px; margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;"></span></span> <div class="paragraph" style="display:block;"><span style="color:rgb(98, 98, 98)">最後一樣兵器是竹筒背袋，剛開始其實是我想做跟deadpool類似的武器，原本只有鋸二個竹筒結果發現無法做出類似的武器，所以我將第三個竹筒鋸下來，用絕緣膠帶，黏起來，從原本的麻煩背帶修改成，一條繩子綁蝴蝶結就可完成，最後把兩把劍插進去外面兩個竹筒，就可以使用了。</span></div> <hr style="width:100%;clear:both;visibility:hidden;"/> <div><div class="wsite-image wsite-image-border-none" style="padding-top:10px;padding-bottom:10px;margin-left:0;margin-right:0;text-align:center"> <a> <img alt="圖片" src="../../uploads/2/9/4/4/2944166/published/img-7859.jpg?1563160294" style="width:470;max-width:100%"/> </a> <div style="display:block;font-size:90%"></div> </div></div>
</div>
